Headline selection-unbiased estimate: grouped nested5-fold balanced accuracy    
0.870152 ± 0.076360 (sample fold standard deviation). Baseline 0.500000 ±       
0.000000. Paired difference 0.370152 ± 0.076360. This estimates the entire      
selection procedure, not a separately held-out final fitted forest.             

Outer folds remain untouched by candidate selection; inner4-fold GroupKFold     
compares fixed majority, depth2 tree, C1 logistic and100-tree depth3 forest. No 
post-error candidates were added. Equal fixed-configuration budget, zero        
hyperparameter searches. Candidates within the best candidate's one-fold SD are 
treated as tied; choose in simplicity order majority→tree→logistic→forest. The  
architecture order was fixed before inspecting validation scores.               

                                                                                
